From 25dc5c34281c2f2c137ffaf95ba603f67a996532 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:04:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] v850: Realign FXU frames

Realign frames that keep vectors on the stack or save wr registers, use
a dynamic realignment pointer when the stack changes at run time, and
describe these frames in the call frame information.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
---
 gcc/config/v850/fxu.md                        |  29 +++
 gcc/config/v850/v850.cc                       | 208 +++++++++++++++---
 gcc/config/v850/v850.h                        |  11 +-
 gcc/doc/sourcebuild.texi                      |   4 +
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-align32.c   |  14 ++
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-alloca.c    |   8 +-
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-arg-const.c |  15 ++
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-cfi.c       |  25 +++
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-debug.c     |  15 ++
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-epilogue.c  |  18 ++
 .../gcc.target/v850/fxu-nonlocal-label.c      |  19 ++
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-save.c      |   7 +-
 .../gcc.target/v850/fxu-slot-align-run.c      |  26 +++
 gcc/testsuite/lib/target-supports.exp         |  20 ++
 14 files changed, 378 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-align32.c
 create mode 100644 gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/v850/fxu-arg-const.c
